  "prefLabel": "Jus 401.18 Entity",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 401.18 “Entity” means an organization created as a corporation, express trust, or unincorporated association. The term does not include a partnership or limited liability company.\n\nSource. #13455, eff 10-7-22; ss by #14162, eff 12-27-24",
